Versioning choice for specs/ and plans/ (nothing written yet — relay this to the user):
  1. versioned — the team's specs, plans, decisions and sprint records are reviewed in
     pull requests and kept in history. Re-run: init --vcs versioned
  2. ignored — they stay on this machine only; no roadmap detail reaches the remote.
     Re-run: init --vcs ignored
  Trade-off and how to switch later: frameworks/artifact-versioning.md
